{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/0b7ce8f98c564f53ed0141025b04d866.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/0b7ce8f98c564f53ed0141025b04d866.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/0b7ce8f98c564f53ed0141025b04d866.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Steam &quot;Extra Krusty Edition&quot; of SpongeBob: Krusty Cook-Off is here! We are bringing you all of the fun of the original with none of the grind! Access tons of FREE decorative items, costumes, kitchen gear and more, experience unlimited play and unleash four, Steam power-ups to help you show off your skill behind the grill!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let\u2019s get cookin\u2019!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fa7d81a3ebc1f15e30783fb765cd5fbd.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fa7d81a3ebc1f15e30783fb765cd5fbd.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fa7d81a3ebc1f15e30783fb765cd5fbd.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join SpongeBob SquarePants on a hilarious culinary adventure through the restaurants and kitchens of Bikini Bottom! When Mr. Krabs realizes there\u2019s more money to be earned in the fast-food business, the penny-pinching entrepreneur sets out to expand his restaurant empire starting with a breakfast stand outside of SpongeBob\u2019s house\u2026and who better to help him run it than SpongeBob SquarePants himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Bikini Bottom kitchen, decorate and customize your restaurant, and get ready to serve up delicious food to your guests! In this fast-food cooking game, put your time management skills to the test and experience the crazy cooking action of the SpongeBob universe. Fire up the grill and get ready to cook!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun and Fast-Paced Cooking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/90cc5e70293b8634286483c5335d02f4.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/90cc5e70293b8634286483c5335d02f4.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/90cc5e70293b8634286483c5335d02f4.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook and serve up delicious food including Krabby Patties, pancakes, BBQ and more! Get behind the grill as SpongeBob SquarePants to provide speedy service to the residents of Bikini Bottom. You\u2019ll serve tons of familiar faces like Patrick Star, Sandy Cheeks, Squidward and many more! Keep your customers happy and be rewarded with tips, likes and exciting bonuses! Start as a junior fry cook and train to become one of Bikini Bottom\u2019s premier fast-food chefs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World of SpongeBob SquarePants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/db8dfe7d491c0dd24d9af169e99dd4ff.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/db8dfe7d491c0dd24d9af169e99dd4ff.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/db8dfe7d491c0dd24d9af169e99dd4ff.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill up delicious Krabby Patties in the Krusty Krab, Steaks and Ribs in Sandy\u2019s Treedome, Hot Dogs in Weenie Hut Jr\u2019s and much more as you explore familiar restaurants and new kitchens in Bikini Bottom, Goo Lagoon and beyond! New restaurants and cuisines are added regularly, bringing new cooking challenges and recipes to learn!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade and Decorate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/e0c99bf68f4ede86755906fd198b04a9.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/e0c99bf68f4ede86755906fd198b04a9.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/e0c99bf68f4ede86755906fd198b04a9.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose new furniture, decorations and more to add your personal touch to the restaurants of SpongeBob SquarePants. Upgrade your kitchen equipment to cook food quickly and provide faster service to your customers. Start out with a basic restaurant design and build your kitchen to one fit for an expert chef! Unlock your favorite characters from SpongeBob SquarePants and dress them in amazing outfits inspired by the show! Create your own custom avatar for the game and interact with the costumed characters as they explore Bikini Bottom. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hilarious Storyline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fe8792d739e6b95e3fd6dc24b78ba666.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fe8792d739e6b95e3fd6dc24b78ba666.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fe8792d739e6b95e3fd6dc24b78ba666.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an all-new and exclusive SpongeBob SquarePants story featuring SpongeBob, Mr. Krabs, Squidward, Sandy and Patrick. Play through the hilarious storyline as you progress through the game and unlock new levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I'm Ready!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/54da24371768a27f2bff27c5d3af2b5b2ae6f5f3.jpg"},{"name":"Level Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/b267da19459d3baf373c97d23718b5a9683668a8.jpg"},{"name":"Fry Cook Freshman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/ff68747a60503d236f2c63a0895e0a627fe02fd0.jpg"},{"name":"Spatula Starter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/de30e4c17872e0a54fe207ed1335c5f3ddf78e9d.jpg"},{"name":"Patty Party","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/1d7dd90be9b7beb5301e355aaec31df7c633f179.jpg"},{"name":"All I know is fine dining and breathing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/ad8a08c9a37069b6d1cb4f8323829c1860d70159.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/a6752ee458645eabd1c50abbbf8f2fc05b2f50fe.jpg"},{"name":"Krusty Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/e37f2dda8b1bf5b0fafe500e2e2c4a1c0961ab48.jpg"},{"name":"Console Power Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/dae9a03fef5e78237c6b104306b2664305b900cc.jpg"},{"name":"Jellyfish Jam","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3592510/499a85a8774853788ebeda47989f321a94442155.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592510?t=1771590736","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/82c8e68214b6e6d0e7ab17648ad67d6da759da1c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771590736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/123623091f986c7b1a64253fe33b028fac1e423d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771590736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/123623091f986c7b1a64253fe33b028fac1e423d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771590736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/0b7ce8f98c564f53ed0141025b04d866.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/0b7ce8f98c564f53ed0141025b04d866.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/0b7ce8f98c564f53ed0141025b04d866.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Steam &quot;Extra Krusty Edition&quot; of SpongeBob: Krusty Cook-Off is here! We are bringing you all of the fun of the original with none of the grind! Access tons of FREE decorative items, costumes, kitchen gear and more, experience unlimited play and unleash four, Steam power-ups to help you show off your skill behind the grill!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let\u2019s get cookin\u2019!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fa7d81a3ebc1f15e30783fb765cd5fbd.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fa7d81a3ebc1f15e30783fb765cd5fbd.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fa7d81a3ebc1f15e30783fb765cd5fbd.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join SpongeBob SquarePants on a hilarious culinary adventure through the restaurants and kitchens of Bikini Bottom! When Mr. Krabs realizes there\u2019s more money to be earned in the fast-food business, the penny-pinching entrepreneur sets out to expand his restaurant empire starting with a breakfast stand outside of SpongeBob\u2019s house\u2026and who better to help him run it than SpongeBob SquarePants himself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own Bikini Bottom kitchen, decorate and customize your restaurant, and get ready to serve up delicious food to your guests! In this fast-food cooking game, put your time management skills to the test and experience the crazy cooking action of the SpongeBob universe. Fire up the grill and get ready to cook!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun and Fast-Paced Cooking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/90cc5e70293b8634286483c5335d02f4.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/90cc5e70293b8634286483c5335d02f4.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/90cc5e70293b8634286483c5335d02f4.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook and serve up delicious food including Krabby Patties, pancakes, BBQ and more! Get behind the grill as SpongeBob SquarePants to provide speedy service to the residents of Bikini Bottom. You\u2019ll serve tons of familiar faces like Patrick Star, Sandy Cheeks, Squidward and many more! Keep your customers happy and be rewarded with tips, likes and exciting bonuses! Start as a junior fry cook and train to become one of Bikini Bottom\u2019s premier fast-food chefs!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World of SpongeBob SquarePants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/db8dfe7d491c0dd24d9af169e99dd4ff.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/db8dfe7d491c0dd24d9af169e99dd4ff.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/db8dfe7d491c0dd24d9af169e99dd4ff.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grill up delicious Krabby Patties in the Krusty Krab, Steaks and Ribs in Sandy\u2019s Treedome, Hot Dogs in Weenie Hut Jr\u2019s and much more as you explore familiar restaurants and new kitchens in Bikini Bottom, Goo Lagoon and beyond! New restaurants and cuisines are added regularly, bringing new cooking challenges and recipes to learn!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade and Decorate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/e0c99bf68f4ede86755906fd198b04a9.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/e0c99bf68f4ede86755906fd198b04a9.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/e0c99bf68f4ede86755906fd198b04a9.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose new furniture, decorations and more to add your personal touch to the restaurants of SpongeBob SquarePants. Upgrade your kitchen equipment to cook food quickly and provide faster service to your customers. Start out with a basic restaurant design and build your kitchen to one fit for an expert chef! Unlock your favorite characters from SpongeBob SquarePants and dress them in amazing outfits inspired by the show! Create your own custom avatar for the game and interact with the costumed characters as they explore Bikini Bottom. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hilarious Storyline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fe8792d739e6b95e3fd6dc24b78ba666.poster.avif?t=1771590736\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fe8792d739e6b95e3fd6dc24b78ba666.webm?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/extras/fe8792d739e6b95e3fd6dc24b78ba666.mp4?t=1771590736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an all-new and exclusive SpongeBob SquarePants story featuring SpongeBob, Mr. Krabs, Squidward, Sandy and Patrick. Play through the hilarious storyline as you progress through the game and unlock new levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Entalto Studios"],"dlc":[3865570],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592510/5ec90c128d51d6ae9c3a0f39437318b7c544d7b6/header.jpg?t=1771590736","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Viacom International Inc. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon Mac M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Built-in<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Ventura 13.0<br></li><l